# Consolidate two canonical persons that turned out to be the same real
# person (e.g. a fresh face-derived id that should have resolved to an
# existing, long-known voice/face identity). All of secondary_person_id's
# face/voice profiles move to primary_person_id, which is the id that
# survives; secondary_person_id is deleted.
string primary_person_id
string secondary_person_id
---
bool success
string message
string person_id
